		"name": "Unopim DAM API",
		"description": "The UnoPim DAM API.\n\nAuthenticated with a Bearer token (OAuth2 / Passport) — set the `token` and `url` collection variables (or an environment). Every route is under `/api/v1/rest` and guarded by `auth:api` + the `api.dam.*` API-key permissions. Directory-level ACL further scopes what each caller can see and act on.\n\nSections: Asset, Directory, Comment, Property, Tag, Share, Linked Resources.",
